WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:06.395 line:3%
  Three days before the close, the bank shows  
  two hundred and seventy-nine thousand, nine  
  hundred and seventy-five pounds.  

2
00:00:06.651 --> 00:00:08.637 line:3%
  The target is three hundred thousand.  

3
00:00:08.914 --> 00:00:11.704 line:3%
  Twenty thousand and twenty-five  
  short, but nobody owes that.  

4
00:00:12.148 --> 00:00:14.345 line:3%
  Goku's bank took a  
  twenty-five pound charge.  

5
00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:17.952 line:3%
  The third investor paid twice and  
  is owed ten thousand back.  

6
00:00:18.593 --> 00:00:20.833 line:3%
  The fourth has not paid: thirty thousand.  

7
00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:24.039 line:3%
  Three separate problems, and  
  one number that hid them.  

8
00:00:25.139 --> 00:00:26.099 line:3%
  Vegeta.  
